From: shawn-makes-stuff <shawn.rains@rocketmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:05:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 23/23] rusticc: the Rusticc binary, kaliru with Rust-AFC built
 in

The rusticc crate (rusticc/): kaliru (this tree) with the native plugins
Rusticc ships, Rust-AFC for AFC (Canvas, ACE Pro / ACE 2), registered
through kaliru's native plugin API. Cargo [patch] builds Rust-AFC against
this kaliru. Built by tools/build_cc1.sh, installed as /usr/bin/rusticc.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015j6wmNX3xANfteuEeqMb2L
